ing that feels right for you. What have you been focusing on since then? Redirecting your energy into new creative pursuits can be incredibly liberating, allowing you to thrive as an artist in your own right and explore territories you've always wanted to delve into.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\", \"id\": \"answer\", \"time_scope\": null}, {\"description\": \"What are the user's preferred weekend activities or past getaway experiences?\", \"id\": \"subtask_weekend_preferences\", \"time_scope\": null}]"
